{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29901","headline":"垂柳 · 李商隐","name":"垂柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"垂柳碧鬅茸，楼昏雨带容。\n思量成夜梦，束久废春慵。\n梳洗凭张敞，乘骑笑稚恭。\n碧虚随转笠，红烛近高舂。\n怨目明秋水，愁眉淡远峰。\n小阑花尽蝶，静院醉醒蛩。\n旧作琴台凤，今爲药店龙。\n宝匳抛掷久，一任景阳钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}